### lckfb-tspi-3m-dsi-c42388916

One of the three official MIPI DSI screens of the LCKFB TaishanPi 3M. Load only one.

3.1 inch, 480x800. Display and backlight only, the CST128 touch
controller has no driver enabled. Not tested on hardware.

The overlay enables the DSI controller on video port 2, the panel through the
rocknix,generic-dsi driver, the backlight on PWM2 channel 2 and, where listed, the
touch controller on I2C0. HDMI stays on video port 0 and DisplayPort on video port 1.

The board's lckfb-tspi-3m-screen service detects the attached screen at boot and
sets the matching overlay, so it normally does not have to be chosen by hand.
